{"title":"Next To Godliness","link":"http://bestof.metafilter.com/2025/01/Next-to-Godliness","date":1735979499000,"content":"<p><img src=\"//mefi.us/images/bestof/5707042E09FA1301C9686D4295465F0A.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"332\" alt=\"scene of a window with light beige curtains slightly parted, allowing soft natural light to enter. A small potted plant sits on the windowsill, adding a touch of greenery and life to the otherwise simple and serene composition\" /><br /><span>image via pixabay.com</span></p><p>Maybe one of the best things you'll ever read about how to think about cleaning / organizing in your home or personal space: <a href=\"https://ask.metafilter.com/383734/I-want-to-end-the-cycle-of-managing-my-living-space\">I want to end the cycle of managing my living space</a>. Yes, the whole thread. Fantastic advice abounds — well-done, mefites!!</p>","author":"taz","siteTitle":"Best of MetaFilter","siteHash":"da9b129197e360b054d48df4b2b523c9cf9eb040c0f8107f5b90f9a1588086c5","entryHash":"f0536d7c49a87606e163ff001ca0bd61e52e43140441dd76c91333bf09deb550","category":"Sites"}